{"pin":"AB02921","subcodes":[{"code":"AB02921","anchor":"","first_line":"O steadfast and firm one! Your letter was received and its contents brought joy and gladness, for they testified to steadfastness [3.5s]... ...It is the hope of ‘Abdu’l?Baha that those youthful souls in the schoolroom of the deeper knowledge will be tended by one who traineth them to love","first_line_orig":"ای ثابت نابت نامه تو رسید مضمون مورث سرور بود و موجب حبور زیرا دلالت بر ثبات  ","language":"Per","word_count":"220","translations":[],"writing_refs":[{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"fa","lang_name":"Persian"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"en","lang_name":"English"},{"type":"swab","type_name":"Selections from the Writings of 'Abdu'l-Bahá","language":"orig","lang_name":"Original"}],"refs":[{"kind":"publication","code":"MMK1#107 p.130x","source":"MMK1","locator":"107 p.130x","url":"https://www.bahai.org/r/178538659"},{"kind":"publication","code":"MUH3.288","source":"MUH3","locator":"288","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/286.pdf#page=304"},{"kind":"publication","code":"TRBB.025","source":"TRBB","locator":"025","url":"https://bahai-library.com/bahailib/236.pdf#page=29"},{"kind":"translation","code":"SWAB#107x","source":"SWAB","locator":"107x","url":"http://www.bahai.org/r/499846679"}]}]}
